+type meets the descent set `D(x)`; that is,
+`F_x ∩ ⋃_{earlier} F_y = ⋃_{s ∈ D(x)} (F_s)_x`. -/
+theorem mem_earlier_chamber_iff (hp : InChamber x p) :
+    (∃ y, y ≠ x ∧ RACG.clen A y ≤ RACG.clen A x ∧ InChamber y p) ↔
